SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships the open-source schemas and reference algorithms for
the differential accessibility CI gate: finding fingerprint construction,
DOM selector normalisation, DiffResult envelope, BaselinePolicy resolver,
GateDecision builder, and SARIF 2.1.0 emitter.

The package has zero runtime dependencies. It relies only on the Node 22+
standard library (`node:crypto` for SHA-256) and ships an RFC 8785 JCS
canonicalisation implementation inline.

